# SLAYER_SHELF names the citation shelf, the papers numbers are verified
# against. it defaults to shelf/ in the tree, so it is not declared with
# needs; a builder who keeps a shelf elsewhere sets it in their game
# config with set, and it then wins.

# before slayer builds or is checked, every measured number in its
# research data is held to its source: pinned, on the citation shelf
# (shelf/ in the tree unless SLAYER_SHELF names another), on its page.
pre-build . :: go run ./cmd/sources verify
